## THE TEXT RULES: the scanner is the PROJECT'S OWN
Copy `<project>/.tools/b1785/b1785.py` to `.tools/b2030/proj_b1785_copy.py` with `cp -n`, prove it with `cmp` and print its sha256 (THE SOURCES row 6); **never edit it, never run it as a program**; load it with `importlib` and call `scan_record` on every added record line and `scan_jira` on every Jira text, and use its `Jira` reader and `real_transport` for every Jira request (the reader reads the project's `.env` in-process and prints nothing of it), your fence in front. **A hit outside the codes this kit names is a STOP for that text, never a re-wording by you.**

